    "path": "tests/handover/testdata/history/follow-up-49/netbird-8473-comment-provenance.json",
    "pointer": "/body",
    "expected": "Adding an independent sample of the same symptom from our 2026-11-04 AT01 run (`3eb3960d-c411-4648-8d77-bba40b436ae3`), examined retrospectively in follow-up 23.\n\nThe retained captures show a WireGuard type-2 response with an IPv6 loopback (`::1`) source:\n\n- Node packet **158** leaves **eth2** at **08:22:37.385050Z**.\n- Member packet **161** arrives on **eth1** at **08:22:37.385059Z**, with the same IP-packet SHA-256.\n- Both decoded packets have **92 bytes of WireGuard payload**, **UDP length 100**, **IP length 140**, and UDP ports **51820 → 51820**. Public records use an anonymized source label identified as IPv6 loopback.\n- Over the enclosing counter-read interval, the member's **`Ip6InHdrErrors` increases from 0 to 1**, while its WireGuard receive accounting remains zero.\n\nThis corrects our earlier inference from the zero WireGuard counter: the response did reach the member's underlay ingress. The evidence locates the remaining gap **after member underlay ingress and before WireGuard receive accounting**. We have no packet-specific kernel drop trace for this sample; the counter increment does not prove which packet caused it, and these records do not prove the source-selection mechanism.\n\nThe retrospective extraction was checked against the original capture byte counts and SHA-256 receipts. The original uncounted outcome is unchanged. Successful initial transfers in a later run do not establish that this issue is fixed.\n\nEvidence, pinned to commit `52b93845b5cfeac1dd63e04c700857fcd098a7f6`:\n\n- [Decoded packet headers, original capture receipts, counter readbacks, and limits](https://github.com/TED-H-com/Freedom-VPN/blob/52b93845b5cfeac1dd63e04c700857fcd098a7f6/docs/e2e/at/members/F23-retrospective-F22-AT01.json)\n- [Follow-up 23 analysis](https://github.com/TED-H-com/Freedom-VPN/blob/52b93845b5cfeac1dd63e04c700857fcd098a7f6/docs/e2e/at/members/followup23-2026-11-04.md#f22-at01-check-the-old-inference-then-read-this-run)\n- [Recorded blocker and limits](https://github.com/TED-H-com/Freedom-VPN/blob/52b93845b5cfeac1dd63e04c700857fcd098a7f6/docs/e2e/at/members/BLOCKERS.md)\n"
  },
